# Personal source material: PDFs being ingested and gold sets written against
# them. The repo is public; the documents and their contents stay local.
# Gold sets are private by default - a pattern, so a new one never has its name
# (let alone its questions) written here. Name one *.public.json to share it.
*.pdf
evalsets/*.json
!evalsets/*.public.json

